  "private": true,
  "description": "Crustdata Company Researcher: open source company research agent for sales and prospecting. Domain or name in, brief out: headcount by department and location, hiring, executives with start dates, funding, traffic, tech stack, news and questions to ask. Web app, JSON API and CLI on the Crustdata API.",
